{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-atelis","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"atelis-meraas-dubai-design-district","about":"Atelis by Meraas is a waterfront residential development located in the heart of Dubai Design District (d3). Rising gracefully along the Creekside shoreline, Atelis offers a premium selection of 1 to 4-bedroom apartments, exclusive 4-bedroom sky villas, and ultra-luxurious 5-bedroom penthouses.Designed by the world-renowned architectural firm Skidmore, Owings &amp; Merrill (SOM)—the creative minds behind the Burj Khalifa—Atelis promises residents breathtaking views of the Dubai skyline and serene waterfront. At the ground level, the development features cascading water elements, lush garden rooms, and tranquil indoor-outdoor lounges, all curated to offer a sense of privacy and refined exclusivity.Just minutes from Downtown Dubai, City Walk, and Business Bay, Atelis is the ideal choice for those who value connectivity, creativity, and sophisticated urban living. It presents a thoughtfully curated lifestyle that blends the serenity of resort-style living with the vibrancy of a dynamic city setting.","price":2100000,"title":"Atelis","bitrix":{"id":1173,"pf_id":null,"source":null,"project_id":"Atelis","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Atelis","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Meraas","project_location":"Design District"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Atelis_at_Dubai_Design_District_D3_by_Meraas_2f8ee84cc4.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/Atelis_at_Dubai_Design_District_D3_by_Meraas_2f8ee84cc4.webp"}],"status":null,"_geoloc":{"lat":25.190123414621,"lng":55.304037447323},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/Atelis_at_Dubai_Design_District_D3_by_Meraas_27d1a79c87.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/